@startuml
!include _seq-style.puml
title 3.6.6 RegisterMember

actor "Cashier" as C
boundary "POS UI" as UI <<boundary>>
control "CustomerController" as CC <<control>>
control "CustomerService" as S <<service>>
entity "CustomerRepository" as R <<entity>>

== Register member ==
C -> UI: enter customer + Save
activate UI
UI -> CC: POST /api/customers\n(CreateCustomerRequest)
activate CC
CC -> S: createCustomer(request)
activate S
S -> R: save(customer)
activate R
R --> S: Customer
deactivate R
S --> CC: CustomerListItemResponse
deactivate S
CC --> UI: 200 JSON
deactivate CC
UI --> C: attach customer to sale
deactivate UI

@enduml
